- label: an in-stream `{"error":…}` data frame on the Chat Completions wire is surfaced as a typed ViktorRunFailedError carrying the worker message, not as a normal end of stream
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'in-stream error frame'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]
- a Responses `response.failed` event and an Anthropic `event: error` are surfaced as ViktorRunFailedError and the trailing `[Stream error: …]` text is dropped @spec
- label: keep-alive comment lines are ignored by the parser and never surface as content
  command: scripts/vt.sh packages/core test/core.test.ts 'ignores keep-alive comments'
  tags: [implemented, core-ts]

