# core/testing
- label: every Core ships recorded Fixtures for: plain text, streaming text, tool call, tool-result follow-up, image input, run_failed non-streaming, run_failed streaming, rate limit 429, auth 401
  command: for f in chat-text chat-stream-text chat-stream-tool-call chat-tool-result-followup chat-image chat-run-failed chat-stream-run-failed chat-rate-limit chat-auth-401 chat-empty-reply chat-stream-ended-without-output; do test -f fixtures/$f.json || exit 1; done
  tags: [implemented]
- label: every Core ships a LiveContractTest that sends a real request when VIKTOR_API_KEY is set and asserts a non-empty reply and a working tool round-trip
  command: test -f packages/core/test/live.test.ts && test -f python/core/tests/test_live.py && (cd packages/core && env -u VIKTOR_API_KEY npx vitest run test/live.test.ts 2>&1 | grep -q 'LIVE CONTRACT TEST SKIPPED')
  tags: [implemented]

