# upstream
- every Tier 1 framework has a submission kit with the patch or branch, the exact submission text and a checklist, and nothing is submitted by automation @draft

# maintenance
- CI runs every adapter against the min, latest and next upstream versions and a next failure opens an issue instead of failing the build @draft
- every adapter README states the tested upstream versions and the date, generated from the CI matrix @draft

